        "cooked": "<p>Burn baby burn</p><aside class=\"onebox allowlistedgeneric\" data-onebox-src=\"https://theletterspage.libsyn.com/episode-312-writers-room-ra-god-of-the-sun-1\">\n  <header class=\"source\">\n\n      <a href=\"https://theletterspage.libsyn.com/episode-312-writers-room-ra-god-of-the-sun-1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">theletterspage.libsyn.com</a>\n  </header>\n\n  <article class=\"onebox-body\">\n    <img width=\"250\" height=\"250\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/c/ca864864fd4764e914bcab3670be2db68d1c0662.jpeg\" class=\"thumbnail onebox-avatar\" data-dominant-color=\"938C83\">\n\n<h3><a href=\"https://theletterspage.libsyn.com/episode-312-writers-room-ra-god-of-the-sun-1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">The Letters Page: Episode #312 - Writers' Room: Ra: God of the Sun #1</a></h3>\n\n  <p>We're number 1! Or, at least, the issue this episode is about is #1!  Show Notes: Run Time: 1:29:29 Hey! It's time to introduce a character who has been around for a long time but we've barely talked about! No, not Ra. We've said so much about him....</p>\n\n\n  </article>\n\n  <div class=\"onebox-metadata\">\n    \n    \n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"clear: both\"></div>\n</aside>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/a/abca02703c0561b2f9d6e1c90769d90a40105504.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/abca02703c0561b2f9d6e1c90769d90a40105504\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/a/abca02703c0561b2f9d6e1c90769d90a40105504_2_353x500.jpeg\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"ovIrX67JLRFXWhTDT5QNH1vlbec\" width=\"353\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/a/abca02703c0561b2f9d6e1c90769d90a40105504_2_353x500.jpeg, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/a/abca02703c0561b2f9d6e1c90769d90a40105504_2_529x750.jpeg 1.5x, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/a/abca02703c0561b2f9d6e1c90769d90a40105504_2_706x1000.jpeg 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"6C5A3F\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1447×2046 1.61 MB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>",
