        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "Golden Calf isn't a bad name for an energy drink, but Brazen Bull is way better.\n\nCalypso's story ends in Bugbear's stomach; I think if he ever returns from Ur-Space for longer than the few moments he was in Cosmic Contest, there's a fair chance that whatever accomplice threw the Nile water on her statue form, that guy could come back and get Bugbear to sweat her out or puke her back up.\n\nMissed opportunity at the end of Earthstrong's letter to be like \"watch out for your nemesis Airweak!\"\n\nRa's cupcake hour is definitely canon....in the Guise book.\n\nThe big problem with all the new Scions is that none of them seem to have two different modes that they would flip between.  You could kludge things like Bjornson throws an axe once and immediately transforms, or where Sgaiedoth reveals it's true form, but those are pretty weak compared to the printed EE scions.\n\nI think Alpha wouldn't have much to do in the OblivAeon event, but Tabitha Taft would have a ton to do, reporting live from the end times and getting the word out about how the heroes need all the help they can get from literally anyone who can do literally anything to help.  This isn't a battle for Wolf woman, but for wolf Woman.",
